ent-ClothingNeckCloakCentcomBlack = special operations officer cloak
    .desc = The NanoTrasen logo embroidered in gold speaks for itself.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakCentcomAdmiral = admiral's cloak
    .desc = A vibrant green cape with gold stitching, worn by Nanotrasen Navy Admirals.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakHOSCloak = head of security's cloak
    .desc = The black and red cloak of HOS, symbolizes safety and brutality.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakResearchDirector = research director's cloak
    .desc = The purple cape with the DNA helix depicted, demonstrates your omniscience and phenomenality.
ent-ClothingEliteNeckCloakCaptain = captain's cloak
    .desc = The large amount of 24 korat gold, lets you understand your status from afar.
ent-ClothingNeckEliteCloakCECloak = chief engineer's cloak
    .desc = Weighty but very luxurious white coat with gold ribbons. There is a small label on the back "Change fuel at DAM".
ent-ClothingNeckCloakIAACloak = internal affairs agent's cloak
    .desc = Dark fleece head cover. Effectively combines with the general style of an internal affairs agent.
ent-ClothingNeckMedCloak = cloak of compassion
    .desc = Only the best of the best get it. Human who wears it has saved hundreds of lives.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakQM = quartermaster's cloak
    .desc = A cloak ready to walk with you through blood, pain, mats, xenomorphs, or something more exotic. Emphasizes the wearer's wealth with a large chiseled diamond, until you find out it's junk.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakHOPCloak = head of personal's cloak
    .desc = Head of Personal's cloak. A blue, gold-embroidered cape that reminds you who's the Boss.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakBlackSec = security's cloak
    .desc = Black and mysterious.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakDarthHOSCloak = dark Lord's cloak
    .desc = A symbolic and awe-inspiring mantle that perfectly depicts the somber majesty of its wearer.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakWhite = republican army officer's shoulder pad
    .desc = An item of equipment of an elite soldier with the rank of officer.
ent-ClothingNeckCloakAlpha = alpha cloak
